WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.003
Everyone thinks you're, like,
Johnny Superstar over here.

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:04.462
- Yeah.
- Like, you must've been

00:00:04.462 --> 00:00:06.214
sex, drugs and rock 'n' roll
in college.
- Right?

00:00:06.214 --> 00:00:10.427
- Right, yeah.
- But, like, we know that
you're this—

00:00:10.427 --> 00:00:11.886
When was the first time
you had a drink?

00:00:11.886 --> 00:00:13.847
- 22 years old was the first time
I had a drink.
- Damn.

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:15.807
- But you did have a drink at 22?
- Yeah, I did.

00:00:15.807 --> 00:00:19.019
- Why all of a sudden?
- Well...

00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:21.312
it was, uh, to impress a chick.

00:00:21.312 --> 00:00:23.606
- Ohh.
- We were in Vegas.

00:00:23.606 --> 00:00:24.733
We went to Tao.

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:26.317
And this was back when Tao was

00:00:26.317 --> 00:00:27.861
like, you know,
it was at its highest.

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:29.112
- Big time.
- It was at its peak.

00:00:29.112 --> 00:00:30.488
- Huge Buddha—

00:00:30.488 --> 00:00:31.698
- Yeah, yeah, yeah, huge Buddha.
Right.

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:33.742
- Champagne bottles, you know

00:00:33.742 --> 00:00:37.537
coming nonstop,
and the first drink

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:41.833
I decide is gonna be
my first drink ever is Patron.

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:43.835
- Ooh.
- Straight from the bottle.

00:00:43.835 --> 00:00:47.130
No chasers.
Just straight tequila.

00:00:47.130 --> 00:00:49.632
- What I can't get over is,
you're Reggie Bush

00:00:49.632 --> 00:00:51.134
and you're the man,
and you needed

00:00:51.134 --> 00:00:53.011
the liquid courage?

00:00:53.011 --> 00:00:54.429
- For whatever reason...

00:00:54.429 --> 00:00:57.432
I needed the liquid courage
to get me there.
- You did.

00:00:57.432 --> 00:01:00.685
- To get me to that point.
And I blacked out.

00:01:00.685 --> 00:01:02.353
- Right.
- I wake up the next morning.

00:01:02.353 --> 00:01:04.314
There's—my throat is burning.

00:01:04.314 --> 00:01:05.899
I don't know why my
throat's burning.

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:07.484
Then I look on the side
of the bed.

00:01:07.484 --> 00:01:08.818
There's throw-up all
on the side of the bed.

00:01:08.818 --> 00:01:10.695
- Ohh.
- And I'm like, "Damn."

00:01:10.695 --> 00:01:13.239
Like, "What happened?"
- [Laughing]

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:14.991
- I got the hangover from hell.
- The hangover.

00:01:14.991 --> 00:01:16.659
- The hangover from hell.

00:01:16.659 --> 00:01:18.870
So I'm, like, drinking water
and all kinds of stuff.

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:20.288
The next day,
all my boys was like

00:01:20.288 --> 00:01:23.083
"Man, you were
on fire last night."

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:25.752
I was like, "Really?
What'd I do?"

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:27.087
One of my other boys was like

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:28.671
"You turned into
the Incredible Hulk.

00:01:28.671 --> 00:01:30.590
Like, you just get really strong
for no reason."

00:01:30.590 --> 00:01:32.300
They were like,
"You were pickin' people up

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:33.885
you were movin' people
out the way."

00:01:33.885 --> 00:01:35.678
- Oh my God. I've seen
those guys before.

00:01:35.678 --> 00:01:37.597
You were Frank the Tank
that night.

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:39.265
- Yeah, I was Frank the Tank.

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:41.643
- So big star, Heisman Trophy,
rich Reggie Bush—

00:01:41.643 --> 00:01:43.353
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.
- Did it work at least?

00:01:43.353 --> 00:01:44.604
- It did.
- OK.

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:46.481
- Um, it worked.

00:01:46.481 --> 00:01:48.983
Um, but...yeah, it was just
one of those—

00:01:48.983 --> 00:01:53.488
- There was a big price to pay.
- It was a big price to pay.

